# problem #6, host 2026-11-08 (recording 20261107_234433): the focused window
# grew and wanted its headroom, the hidden Battle.net, Claude and Steam
# (~900 MB) went out; 37-81 s later it gave the memory back, 4 GB were free,
# and after 30 quiet seconds they all came back, to go out again at its next
# growth: 1.8 GB of copies a round, and two 0.75 s freezes with Battle.net.
# Hidden apps are in no hurry: they stay out while the window they made room
# for is in focus, come back at once when shown, and by themselves only after
# the room has been there for minutes.
cap 11000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 1625 plasmashell old
proc 3562 Battle.net old chunk=16        # hidden launchers
proc 9000 claude-desktop old chunk=16
proc 4100 steamwebhelper old chunk=16
proc 5000 Wow.exe chunk=64
proc 7000 chrome old chunk=32

hint 1625 v
hint 3562 h
hint 9000 h
hint 4100 h
hint 7000 v
act 1614 0 4
act 1625 0 4
act 3562 600 0
act 9000 600 0
act 4100 600 0
act 7000 5 2
target 1614 280 0.75
target 1625 480 0.4
target 3562 560 0.9
target 9000 220 0.9
target 4100 130 0.9
target 7000 900 0.7
at 10

mark the game is focused and loads: it wants its headroom, the hidden ones go out
hint 5000 f
act 5000 0 30
target 5000 5200 0.75 spread=10
at 30
target 5000 7600 0.75 spread=20
at 90
expect sys 5000 == 0
expect evicted 3562 > 0

mark it gives 2.5 GB back for ten minutes: 4 GB free, nobody comes back while it is in focus
target 5000 5200 0.75 spread=5
at 700
expect restores 3562 == 0
expect restores 9000 == 0
expect restores 4100 == 0

mark it grows and shrinks three more times, half an hour apart
target 5000 7600 0.75 spread=20
at 780
target 5000 5200 0.75 spread=5
at 2500
target 5000 7600 0.75 spread=20
at 2580
target 5000 5200 0.75 spread=5
at 4300
target 5000 7600 0.75 spread=20
at 4380
target 5000 5200 0.75 spread=5
at 4500
expect restores 3562 == 0
expect restores 9000 == 0
expect restores 4100 == 0
expect moved_out 3562 <= 600      # out once, not once a round
expect sys 5000 == 0

mark the user opens Battle.net: it is back at once
hint 5000 v
hint 3562 f
act 3562 0 4
step
at 4502
expect sys 3562 == 0
mark back to the game
hint 3562 h
act 3562 30 0
hint 5000 f
step
at 4520

mark the user switches to Chrome for two minutes and back: still nobody comes back
hint 5000 v
hint 7000 f
step
at 4640
expect restores 9000 == 0
hint 7000 v
hint 5000 f
step
at 4700

mark the game quits; five minutes later the hidden ones are back
free 5000 5200
hint 5000 -
hint 7000 f
step
at 4900
expect restores 9000 == 0
at 5060
expect sys 9000 == 0
expect sys 4100 == 0
